      "text": "Where?",
      "character_start": 1453,
      "character_end": 1459,
      "source_start_sec": 89.149,
      "source_end_sec": 89.533
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-054",
      "line": 546,
      "section": "The Knock",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Was he alone?",
      "character_start": 1461,
      "character_end": 1474,
      "source_start_sec": 89.959,
      "source_end_sec": 90.699
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-055",
      "line": 552,
      "section": "The Knock",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Did he call anyone? Did he say anything?",
      "character_start": 1476,
      "character_end": 1516,
      "source_start_sec": 91.069,
      "source_end_sec": 93.344
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-056",
      "line": 566,
      "section": "The Knock",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "When can I see him?",
      "character_start": 1518,
      "character_end": 1537,
      "source_start_sec": 93.885,
      "source_end_sec": 94.795
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-057",
      "line": 594,
      "section": "The Knock",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "thought",
      "gain": 0.8,
      "text": "You said you'd call tomorrow. You always called. I don't understand how the world can keep moving when you've stopped. I don't know what I'm supposed to do with all the things I haven't told you.",
      "character_start": 1539,
      "character_end": 1734,
      "source_start_sec": 95.079,
      "source_end_sec": 104.303
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-058",
      "line": 614,
      "section": "A House Full of Missing Things",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "He's smiling like that because someone dared him to eat everything,",
      "character_start": 1736,
      "character_end": 1803,
      "source_start_sec": 104.723,
      "source_end_sec": 107.696
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-059",
      "line": 622,
      "section": "A House Full of Missing Things",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "He was,",
      "character_start": 1805,
      "character_end": 1812,
      "source_start_sec": 107.923,
      "source_end_sec": 108.336
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-060",
      "line": 634,
      "section": "A House Full of Missing Things",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "About what?",
      "character_start": 1814,
      "character_end": 1825,
      "source_start_sec": 108.563,
      "source_end_sec": 109.374
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-061",
      "line": 638,
      "section": "A House Full of Missing Things",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "What would you like me to say?",
      "character_start": 1827,
      "character_end": 1857,
      "source_start_sec": 109.801,
      "source_end_sec": 110.796
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-062",
      "line": 642,
      "section": "A House Full of Missing Things",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "I know what you thought.",
      "character_start": 1859,
      "character_end": 1883,
      "source_start_sec": 111.166,
      "source_end_sec": 112.09
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-063",
      "line": 682,
      "section": "A House Full of Missing Things",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Cass, this is disgusting.",
      "character_start": 1885,
      "character_end": 1910,
      "source_start_sec": 112.574,
      "source_end_sec": 114.423
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-064",
      "line": 730,
      "section": "Somewhere Else",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Well, Cass,",
      "character_start": 1912,
      "character_end": 1923,
      "source_start_sec": 114.793,
      "source_end_sec": 115.902
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-065",
      "line": 746,
      "section": "Somewhere Else",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "thought",
      "gain": 0.8,
      "text": "Somewhere nobody knows him. That's all I asked for. One evening where I can just be the woman ordering a drink, instead of the woman with the dead brother.",
      "character_start": 1925,
      "character_end": 2080,
      "source_start_sec": 116.158,
      "source_end_sec": 123.877
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-066",
      "line": 774,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Whiskey, please.",
      "character_start": 2082,
      "character_end": 2098,
      "source_start_sec": 124.418,
      "source_end_sec": 125.612
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-067",
      "line": 778,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "The one that doesn't ask personal questions.",
      "character_start": 2100,
      "character_end": 2144,
      "source_start_sec": 126.124,
      "source_end_sec": 127.874
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-068",
      "line": 784,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "gain": 0.9,
      "text": "Then your favorite.",
      "character_start": 2146,
      "character_end": 2165,
      "source_start_sec": 128.556,
      "source_end_sec": 129.239
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-069",
      "line": 860,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "thought",
      "gain": 0.8,
      "text": "Who are you?",
      "character_start": 2167,
      "character_end": 2179,
      "source_start_sec": 129.666,
      "source_end_sec": 130.269
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-070",
      "line": 862,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "thought",
      "gain": 0.8,
      "text": "You look like the kind of man who has an answer prepared for everything, and not one of them is the truth.",
      "character_start": 2181,
      "character_end": 2287,
      "source_start_sec": 130.623,
      "source_end_sec": 136.127
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-071",
      "line": 864,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "thought",
      "gain": 0.8,
      "text": "Don't start. Don't make somebody else's silence into your problem.",
      "character_start": 2289,
      "character_end": 2355,
      "source_start_sec": 136.81,
      "source_end_sec": 140.237
    },
    {
      "id": "ninja-072",
      "line": 866,
      "section": "The Crooked Lantern",
      "speaker": "ninja",
      "type": "thought",
      "gain": 0.8,
      "text": "So why haven't you looked away?",
      "character_start": 2357,
      "character_end": 2388,
      "source_start_sec": 140.778,
      "source_end_sec": 142.3029931972789
    }
  ]
}